                    "source": "UniProtKB"
                  }
                ],
                "value": "The nuclear-cytoplasmic distribution could be regulated by the availability of calmodulin (By similarity). Localizes to spindle poles during mitosis (PubMed:19690332). Associates with microtubule minus ends (By similarity)"
              }
            ]
